  36 007610* 0005          0005            / Function code. 5 is WRITE.
  37 007611* 0374          0374            / Block = second disk scratch block.
  38 007612* 7400          7400            / Buffer address.
  39 007613* 0000          0000            / Link field.
  40 007614* 7402          HLT
